  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/非常感謝您的-200,000_下載-ff7a3d?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"125k下載\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-mod/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/載入器-Forge-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"載入器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-mod/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/載入器-NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"載入器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-mod/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/載入器-Fabric_即將推出-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"載入器\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-mod/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/即將推出-1.16,_1.17,_1.18-B446C6?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"即將推出\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-mod/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/現已支援-1.19.2,_1.20.1,_1.21.1-B446C6?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"現已支援\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jkfE8C38WG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1477614053596860506?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;color=7289DA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389133/description_6ef290c8-b35c-42f7-8386-4e4e004df8a4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><strong>新增 Curios 欄位編輯器</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389133/description_9551e55a-79c7-4761-be52-ac983ef2f88d.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>目前支援下列模組的欄位：</p><p>[1.20.1] EpicFight 20.10.2 - 20.14.13<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n SpellBooks &nbsp; [僅法書]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticcated Backpacks</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/back-weapon-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back Weapon Slot&nbsp; &nbsp;[部分運作不準確，請等待更新]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 Backpack &nbsp; [完成度 80%]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG BackPacks</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curious-lanterns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curious Lanterns</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-doppelganger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dark Doppelganger</a> &nbsp; [僅法書]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illage-and-spell-age/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illage and Spell-age: Iron's Spells Addon</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[僅法書]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/to-tweaks-irons-spells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">T.O Magic 'n Extras - Iron's Spells Addon</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[僅法書]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Spellbooks</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[僅法書]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-and-combat-x-irons-spells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons And Combat x Iron's Spells</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[僅法書]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries?page=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries &nbsp; [完整支援]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]</p><p>[1.21.1] EpicFight 21.16.1<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries?page=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries &nbsp; [完整支援]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 Backpack &nbsp; [完成度 80%]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG BackPacks</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticcated Backpacks</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[完整支援]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n SpellBooks &nbsp; [僅法書]</a> + [所有附加組件]</p><p>需要較長時間製作的模組：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics+所有附加組件</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;[完成度 35%]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L Ender's Cataclysm</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;[完成度 0%]<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;[完成度 0%]</p><p>由於其渲染和 3D 模型</p><p>（其餘模組支援將根據需求數量決定）&nbsp;</p><p>此模組修復並增加了對 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios?page=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a> 在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> 中的正確渲染支援</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389133/description_7307f780-e248-4e89-b144-b3d9643a7dd8.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389133/description_8fa63656-76f2-4123-bc44-c25d1c43ced5.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389133/description_dc013ad9-4688-4ea0-908a-52d053eee33f.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389133/description_94023503-8bf9-4fe2-9f74-6e63150eeeab.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m_nDpDZHw-Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m_nDpDZHw-Y</a></p>",
